{"id":"9360972f9b2f8524","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-fixed-point-continuity.md","title":"单调性与有向连续性的区别","display":"lem-fixed-point-continuity — 单调性与有向连续性的区别","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-fixed-point-continuity","aliases":["91-lem-fixed-point-continuity","91-lem-fixed-point-cont"],"display":"lem-fixed-point-continuity — 单调性与有向连续性的区别","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-fixed-point-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-fixed-point-continuity</span><span>91-lem-fixed-point-cont</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-continuity — 单调性与有向连续性的区别"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2afb05d81a538d8a\" href=\"?note=2afb05d81a538d8a\" title=\"91-lem-jump-monotonicity\">91-lem-jump-monotonicity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> (集合格上的跳跃)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\\coloneqq\nI\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\,\\exists k\\in I\\,\n(\\Gamma_i\\cup\\Gamma_j\\subseteq\\Gamma_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\\coloneqq\nI\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\,\\exists k\\in I\\,\n(\\Gamma_i\\cup\\Gamma_j\\subseteq\\Gamma_k)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirCont}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\{\\Delta_i\\}_{i\\in K}\\,\n[\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Delta_i\\}_{i\\in K})\\to\nJ(\\bigcup_{i\\in K}\\Delta_i)=\\bigcup_{i\\in K}J(\\Delta_i)]\">\\(\\mathrm{DirCont}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\{\\Delta_i\\}_{i\\in K}\\,\n[\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Delta_i\\}_{i\\in K})\\to\nJ(\\bigcup_{i\\in K}\\Delta_i)=\\bigcup_{i\\in K}J(\\Delta_i)]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I}\">\\(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I}\\)</span> (由包含关系有向的、取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(S)\">\\(\\mathcal P(S)\\)</span> 的集合族)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mon}(J)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{i\\in I}J(\\Gamma_i)\n\\subseteq\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\Gamma_i\\right),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mon}(J)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{i\\in I}J(\\Gamma_i)\n\\subseteq\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\Gamma_i\\right),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>而</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirCont}(J)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\n\\to\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\Gamma_i\\right)\n=\n\\bigcup_{i\\in I}J(\\Gamma_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DirCont}(J)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\n\\to\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\Gamma_i\\right)\n=\n\\bigcup_{i\\in I}J(\\Gamma_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一个包含只用单调性：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_i\">\\(\\Gamma_i\\)</span> 都包含于其并。反向包含要求\n额外的有向连续性，不能由单调性推出。</p>\n<p>带无限量词的强 Kleene 跳跃一般可能在极限阶段首次验证一个全称条件，\n所以并不自动保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-链的并。超限固定点构造在极限阶段定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\">\\(\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta\\)</span>，并不等同于假设\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 与该并交换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity","status":"resolved","id":"2afb05d81a538d8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-lem-jump-monotonicity]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(S)\\to\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall X,Y\\subseteq S\\,(X\\subseteq Y\\to J(X)\\subseteq J(Y))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\\coloneqq\nI\\ne\\varnothing\\land\n\\forall i,j\\in I\\,\\exists k\\in I\\,\n(\\Gamma_i\\cup\\Gamma_j\\subseteq\\Gamma_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirCont}(J)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\{\\Delta_i\\}_{i\\in K}\\,\n[\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Delta_i\\}_{i\\in K})\\to\nJ(\\bigcup_{i\\in K}\\Delta_i)=\\bigcup_{i\\in K}J(\\Delta_i)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}continuity}\\vdash\n\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Mon}(J)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\bigcup_{i\\in I}J(\\Gamma_i)\n\\subseteq\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\Gamma_i\\right),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirCont}(J)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Directed}(\\{\\Gamma_i\\}_{i\\in I})\n\\to\nJ\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{i\\in I}\\Gamma_i\\right)\n=\n\\bigcup_{i\\in I}J(\\Gamma_i).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}\\Gamma_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false}],"bytes":1845,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-fixed-point-continuity]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-fixed-point-continuity]]"}],"outgoing":["ae9eced0b12cbd2a","2afb05d81a538d8a"]}